        "TileImage": "$($repository 39c65545-c42e-4c83-b8fa-0b0593d8534f).Image",
        "Description": "You have been assigned a delicate mission at the prestigious Bloomfield Garden Show. Among the bustling crowd and vibrant displays, your targets are Edwina, a key organizer, and three of her personal security guards. Edwina&apos;s actions have attracted the attention of our client, who seeks her permanent removal from the scene.\r\rYour mission is to eliminate Edwina and her three guards discreetly and ensure their absence does not disrupt the ongoing event.",
